# Achieving True Power (battlefield.achieving_true_power#reqs, Navukgo Execution Chamber): six chars at _1s0, each
# refused with NO_BATTLEFIELD_ENTRY 7277 (the framework's entry hooks) and no menu. Main (a level 75 Puppetmaster at
# level cap 75, Achieving True Power accepted at Quest[1][85]Prog 1 (GMs), one Puppetmaster's Testimony): a trigger
# with no trade (a testimony fight's registrant must trade): 7277, then the door's default (DefaultActions.lua
# messageSpecial -1, shown as 32767); a trade of the Blue Mage's Testimony (not the required item): 7277. Each other
# trades a Puppetmaster's Testimony, all else as main: bob a level 65 Puppetmaster (the level alone); cat at
# Quest[1][85]Prog 2 (the var alone: the registrant's must be 1); dan with the quest available (the quest alone); eve
# with it completed (a registrant's must be accepted); fay a level 75 Warrior (the job alone).
lists NavukgoExecutionChamber/_1s0/onTrade NavukgoExecutionChamber/_1s0/onTrigger NavukgoExecutionChamber/onEventUpdate/32000 NavukgoExecutionChamber/onEventFinish/32000
char zone=NavukgoExecutionChamber pos=-598.5,8,-100 job=PUP lvl=75
char bob zone=NavukgoExecutionChamber pos=-598.5,8,-100 job=PUP lvl=65
char cat zone=NavukgoExecutionChamber pos=-598.5,8,-100 job=PUP lvl=75
char dan zone=NavukgoExecutionChamber pos=-598.5,8,-100 job=PUP lvl=75
char eve zone=NavukgoExecutionChamber pos=-598.5,8,-100 job=PUP lvl=75
char fay zone=NavukgoExecutionChamber pos=-598.5,8,-100 job=WAR lvl=75
levelcap 75
quest AhtUrhgan.NoStringsAttached completed
quest AhtUrhgan.PuppetmasterBlues completed
quest Bastok.AchievingTruePower accepted
charvar Quest[1][85]Prog 1
item PuppetmastersTestimony
bob: levelcap 75
bob: quest AhtUrhgan.NoStringsAttached completed
bob: quest AhtUrhgan.PuppetmasterBlues completed
bob: quest Bastok.AchievingTruePower accepted
bob: charvar Quest[1][85]Prog 1
bob: item PuppetmastersTestimony
cat: levelcap 75
cat: quest AhtUrhgan.NoStringsAttached completed
cat: quest AhtUrhgan.PuppetmasterBlues completed
cat: quest Bastok.AchievingTruePower accepted
cat: charvar Quest[1][85]Prog 2
cat: item PuppetmastersTestimony
dan: levelcap 75
dan: quest AhtUrhgan.NoStringsAttached completed
dan: quest AhtUrhgan.PuppetmasterBlues completed
dan: charvar Quest[1][85]Prog 1
dan: item PuppetmastersTestimony
eve: levelcap 75
eve: quest AhtUrhgan.NoStringsAttached completed
eve: quest AhtUrhgan.PuppetmasterBlues completed
eve: quest Bastok.AchievingTruePower completed
eve: charvar Quest[1][85]Prog 1
eve: item PuppetmastersTestimony
fay: levelcap 75
fay: quest AhtUrhgan.NoStringsAttached completed
fay: quest AhtUrhgan.PuppetmasterBlues completed
fay: quest Bastok.AchievingTruePower accepted
fay: charvar Quest[1][85]Prog 1
fay: item PuppetmastersTestimony
item BlueMagesTestimony
login
bob: login
cat: login
dan: login
eve: login
fay: login
trigger _1s0
finish-if-event
trade _1s0 BlueMagesTestimony x1
finish-if-event
